OL,3,GNEWSAParents oppose appointment of head
OL,4,Ateacher with drink-driving convictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents at a primary school have called
OL,7,Ffor the appointment of a head teacher
OL,8,Fwith two drink-driving convictions to
OL,9,Fbe reconsidered.
OL,11,FFamilies at Tarland School, in
OL,12,FAberdeenshire, were informed the
OL,13,Fpreferred candidate for the position
OL,14,Fwas Anna Royle.
OL,16,FHowever, they then learned she had
OL,17,Fdrink-driving convictions from 2019 and
OL,18,F2024, and have now issued an open
OL,19,Fletter expressing their concerns about
OL,20,Fher suitability for the role.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
